\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Robot-state shift (end-effector teleport) on the Object suite. Top: four frames from a successful episode, showing relative control before the jump, an immediate switch to absolute recovery after the arm is displaced, and return to relative control once the pose residual collapses. Bottom: mean $D_t$, residual weight $r_t=\operatorname  {clip}(\|c_{t,\mathrm  {xyz}}\|/0.05,0,1)$, and $\alpha _t$ over $484$ successfully injected episodes, aligned at the actual injection step, with pointwise bootstrap 95\% confidence intervals. Shading marks the perturbation window.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
